GeoNames gazetteer - https://www.geonames.org
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 - https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

  plugin/data/places.json.gz is an extract of coastal places (harbours, bays and the
  towns behind them) from the GeoNames dump, built by tools/build-places.mjs. The
  plugin uses it aboard to name where a voyage began and ended.
  Current file: built 2026-10-06 from the GeoNames dump of 2026-10-06 and the World
  Port Index as published on 2026-10-06;
  sha256 7ed46496ab48dde6ed2d6b07878cb7404f659aeb16475ea4e06a96993dc4ac72.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
World Port Index (Publication 150) - https://msi.nga.mil
National Geospatial-Intelligence Agency, United States. A work of the US government,
in the public domain.

  Port names and positions from the index are folded into plugin/data/places.json.gz
  where GeoNames does not carry the port under the same name.
